1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,660
你们好
Hi, there.

2
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:05,080
今晚由我为你们服务
I'll be your server for tonight.

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,780
我叫布莱恩 有任何需要尽管叫我
My name is Brian if you guys need anything.

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,840
如果我们没有任何需要该叫你什么
What's your name if we don't need anything?

5
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:09,580
帕特丽夏
Patricia.

6
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:12,500
反应很快嘛 帕特丽夏
You're quick, Patricia!

7
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,680
谢谢 我们今晚的特别鸡尾酒是
Thanks. So, our specialty cocktail for tonight

8
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,160
罗勒莫吉托
is a basil-infused mojito.

9
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:19,220
不错 我们要三杯
Oh, yum! We'll take three.

10
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,060
不用了 没关系 我不想喝酒
Uh, no. That's okay. I'm good.

11
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:24,020
拜托 跟我们一起在这特别的夜晚
Come on, now. Join us for a specialty cocktail

12
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,640
-喝杯特别的鸡尾酒吧 -就是
- on our specialty evening. - Yeah.

13
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:26,500
-请给我们三杯 -好的
- Three, please. - Okay.

14
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,820
你不喝的话 会有人喝的
If you don't drink it, someone will.

15
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:32,900
那个布莱恩真是个帅哥 是吧
Well, that Brian sure is a cutie, huh?

16
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:35,340
我真想要那两片嘴唇 我是说在我身上
I'd kill to have those lips. I mean on me.

17
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:37,360
我是说想要他的嘴唇在我嘴上
I mean I want his lips on my mouth.

18
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,000
我们能直接切入正题吗
Uh, can we just cut to the chase?

19
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:39,700
他的嘴唇很性感
He's got great lips.

20
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,180
不不不 我们在这里干什么
No, no, no, no, no. What are we doing here?

21
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,100
你们有什么目的
What is this about?

22
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:44,060
没什么 我们就是想跟我们的女儿
Nothing! We just wanted to have a fun night out

23
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:44,600
出来放松一下
with our daughter.

24
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,200
是啊 就把我们当做你的朋友
Yeah! Just think of us as your friends.

25
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:48,490
-是啊 -我可没有45岁的朋友
- Yeah! - I don't have 45-year-old friends.

26
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,940
你的父母也还没45岁呢 亲爱的
Well, you don't have 45-year-old parents yet, either, honey,

27
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:51,540
别激动
so calm down.

28
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:54,700
海莉对她的未来毫无规划
Haley has no plan for her future whatsoever.

29
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,220
她住在我们的地下室里
She's living in our basement,

30
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:59,360
在社区大学上课 整天混日子
taking community-college classes, and, well, meandering.

31
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:01,300
所以我们打算带她出去 放松一下
So we're gonna take her out. We'll have some fun.

32
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:03,140
让她放松警惕
And then gently ease her

33
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:05,040
跟我们友好地聊聊她的未来
into a friendly conversationabout her future.

34
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:08,140
跟我们过去采取的方式截然不同
As opposed to the approach that we've taken in the past.

35
00:01:10,550 --> 00:01:12,440
你打算以后就干这个吗
Is this what you're gonna do with your life --

36
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:13,920
睡懒觉 然后自拍
Sleep late and take a selfie?!

37
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:15,720
你为什么总是批评我
Why are you always criticizing me?!

38
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,220
你想这样开始新的一天吗
Is this really how you want to start the day?!

39
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,840
我的一天五小时前就开始了
My day started 5 hours ago.

40
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:20,280
我的压力很大
I am under a lot of pressure!

41
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:22,540
怎么大 如何大 你一周只有三节课
How?! How?! You take three classes a week,

42
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:23,640
还逃了一半
and you miss half of them!

43
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,140
车很难停
The parking is tricky!

44
00:01:25,167 --> 00:01:26,760
早上好 宝贝 我给你留了些午餐
Morning, sunshine. I saved you some lunch.

45
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:29,501
我知道了 好吗 我是很懒 天呐
I get it, okay?! I'm lazy! God!

46
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:53,420
你知道我最烦什么吗
You know what drives me crazy?

47
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:56,220
晚餐期间接到询问客户满意度的电话
Getting these customer-satisfaction calls during dinner.

48
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:57,560
他们给车换了油而已
They change the oil on your car,

49
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,240
却期待着我写感谢信
they want a love letter!

50
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:00,800
没错 我还在等我的医生打来电话
I know. I'm waiting for a call from my doctor's office --

51
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,740
"请评价您的前列腺检查
"Please rate your prostate exam.

52
00:02:03,060 --> 00:02:04,560
您满意吗"
Would you say you were satisfied?"

53
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,900
我希望你没有
I hope you weren't.

54
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,020
"我希望你没有"
"I hope you weren't."

55
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:10,060
这太好笑了 歌洛莉亚
That's a good one, Gloria!

56
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,980
你知道用第二语言
Do you know how hard it is

57
00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:14,260
幽默一下有多困难吗 杰
to be funny in a second language, Jay?

58
00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:18,080
这位美丽的小姐真不错
Esta Hermosa Dama es muy buena.

59
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:20,080
达琳 你在学西班牙语吗
Ay, Darlene, you're learning Spanish?

60
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:22,700
是啊 小短和我开始上课了
Yes, Shorty and I have been taking classes.

61
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,200
-我们越说越好了 -当然
- We're getting good. - Oh, yeah.

62
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:25,671
太棒了
I es maravilloso!

63
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,120
你说的是"太棒了" 对吗
You said "That's wonderful," right?

64
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,900
我的意大利语功底帮了我
My Italian helps me.

65
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,480
为什么突然对西语感兴趣
Why the sudden interest in Spanish?

66
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:32,480
其实我们有件事想告诉你们
Well, actually, there's something we have to tell you,

67
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,040
好吧 你们看如何 我们
you know? All right. How's this? We're-

68
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:36,791
-我们要搬去哥斯达黎加啦 -是的
- We're moving to Costa Rica! - Yeah!

69
00:02:36,791 --> 00:02:38,127
-什么 -什么时候
- What?! - When?

70
00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:41,180
再过几周 那里的生活成本很低
In a couple of weeks. The cost of living is so low down there,

71
00:02:41,220 --> 00:02:43,320
我们在海边找了个美丽的地方
you know? We found this beautiful place on the water.

72
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,840
还有自己的私人沙滩
It's got its own private beach.

73
00:02:45,180 --> 00:02:46,900
泳衣可穿可不穿
Bathing suits are optional.

74
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:48,780
但还是鼓励穿上
But encouraged.

75
00:02:48,780 --> 00:02:50,740
我会想你们的
Ay, I'm going to miss you guys.

76
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:52,460
别担心 我赌他们最多能坚持三个月
Don't worry about it. I give it three months, tops.

77
00:02:52,580 --> 00:02:55,440
你讨厌沙滩 你知道那里有多潮湿吗
You hate the beach. And you know how humid it is down there?

78
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:57,020
我爱俱乐部的蒸汽房
I love the steam room at the club.

79
00:02:57,180 --> 00:02:59,420
都一样的 除了我再也不用看着你
It's the same thing, except I don't have to see you

80
00:02:59,420 --> 00:03:01,400
像一滩化了的冰淇淋一样摊在那里
sitting there like a pile of melted ice cream.

81
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,820
而你披着毛巾就像汤姆·塞立克
'cause you're Tom Selleck in a towel.

82
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:04,100
我已经准备好冒险了
I'm just ready for an adventure.

83
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:05,340
我想尝试些新事物
I want to try something new.

84
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:07,220
待在这里 偶尔交个帐单
Stick around here. Pick up a check every now and then.

85
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,380
你为什么总是这么消极
Why do you always have to be so negative?

86
00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:10,900
我就觉得很好
I think it's great.

87
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:11,960
不 你说得对 我很抱歉
No, you're right. I'm sorry.

88
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:13,700
我就是有点吃惊 仅此而已
I'm surprised, that's all.

89
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:16,520
我们来为你们美好的生活新篇章干一杯吧
Let's toast this amazing new chapter of your lives.

90
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:19,320
敬拳头大小的蚊子
To mosquitoes the size of your fist.

91
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:22,360
难怪你的朋友们一个个都搬走了
This is why all your friends move away.

92
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,900
敬我们 终于有独处时间了
To us, alone at last.

93
00:03:27,900 --> 00:03:30,114
我们两个今晚看起来都很帅
We both look very handsome tonight.

94
00:03:30,775 --> 00:03:32,840
如果 如果你只说
You know, if you -- if you'd just said

95
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,540
我看起来很帅 我就会说 你也是
that I looked handsome, I would have said, "So do you."

96
00:03:34,620 --> 00:03:35,500
我不敢冒险
I couldn't take that chance.

97
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:36,940
我想有个良好的开端
I wanted to get off on the right foot.

98
00:03:37,820 --> 00:03:39,280
米奇尔和我急需一个
Mitchell and I desperately need

99
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,500
浪漫的夜晚来重燃激情
a romantic night out to reconnect.

100
00:03:41,620 --> 00:03:42,260
是啊 我不
Yeah. I don't --

101
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:43,800
我不知道是不是因为筹划婚礼压力太大
I don't know if it's the stress of planning a wedding,

102
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:46,260
但我们最近的关系有点紧张
but we've been a little tense with each other lately, huh?

103
00:03:46,271 --> 00:03:48,808
连我们的朋友马库斯都说我们最近很暴躁
Even our friend J'marcus said how bitchy we've been.

104
00:03:48,808 --> 00:03:49,960
什么 他什么时候说过这话
What -- when did he say that?

105
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,780
在胡娇的派对上
Oh, at Pepper's party

106
00:03:50,780 --> 00:03:52,520
那晚你穿了那条不太合适的裤子
that night you wore those pants that don't fit you anymore.

107
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:54,960
没错 而你带了一瓶大家都讨厌的酒
Oh, right. And you brought that bad wine that everybody hated.

108
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,620
-瞧 我们真的很需要 -真心的
- See? We really need this. - We really do.

109
00:03:58,191 --> 00:03:59,840
那天胡娇说
Oh, you know, uh, Pepper said

110
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,800
为了我们的蛋糕试吃
that for our cake tasting,

111
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:01,860
我们得...
we needed to have --

112
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:05,640
我们说好的 不谈婚礼 不谈莉莉
Remember our rules -- no wedding talk, no Lily talk.

113
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:07,236
抱歉 好吧 你是对的
I'm sorry. No, you're right.

114
00:04:08,635 --> 00:04:10,221
那么我们聊聊...
So, just gonna...

115
00:04:14,220 --> 00:04:15,720
我们再听一遍招牌菜怎么样
Should we hear the specials again?

116
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,456
不能再让他重复第三遍了
We can't ask him a third time.

117
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:21,820
你知道我搬过去以后会做什么吗
You know what I might try when I'm down there?

118
00:04:22,660 --> 00:04:23,020
冲浪
Surfing.

119
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:25,060
那看来你的遗体无法供亲友瞻仰了[死得很惨]
So it's gonna be a closed casket.

120
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:25,620
该我了
My turn.

121
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,420
你在说什么 我刚刚打进了3号球
What are you talking about? I just sunk the 3 ball.

122
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,200
然后你的杆子碰到了白色球
Then you moved the cue ball with your stick

123
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,960
就在你跟我讲要从南加州搬走
while you were telling me how you were gonna move away

124
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:32,760
去学冲浪的时候
from Southern California to try surfing.

125
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:33,800
我没碰白色球
I didn't touch the cue ball.

126
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:34,960
是啊我知道 但你就是碰了
Yeah, I know. But you did.

127
00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:36,440
你说我是骗子吗 你
You're calling me a cheater? You?

128
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:39,408
一个打高尔夫最多数到5杆的家伙
The guy on the golf course who can't seem to count higher than 5?

129
00:04:39,408 --> 00:04:40,920
我忘记杆数是因为
Maybe I can't keep track of my shots

130
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,680
我身边总有个家伙喋喋不休
because somebody won't stop talking.

131
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:44,720
那是因为我天生就爱
It is in my nature to comment on

132
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:47,020
对看到的奇闻异事发表评论
the bizarre and unusual things I see in the world,

133
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:49,200
比如你总是将胡乱一击称为挥杆
like that convulsion you call a golf swing.

134
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:50,220
你猜怎么着 我不打了
You know what? I'm done here.

135
00:04:50,246 --> 00:04:51,644
是我不打了
No, I've done.

136
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:54,140
我不能站在这里接受你对我人品的质疑
I will not have my integrity questioned here.

137
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:55,420
我参加过海军
I was a Marine.

138
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,220
一同服役的伙伴有些都为国捐躯了
I served with guys who died.

139
00:04:57,260 --> 00:04:57,940
那是老死的
Of old age!

140
00:04:58,180 --> 00:04:59,180
你连国门都没出过
You never left the states!

141
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,740
你是说我没为国家效力吗
Are you saying I didn't serve my country?

142
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,120
哪个国家 美国还是哥斯达黎加
Which one, America or Costa Rica?

143
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:03,400
你干嘛老跟哥斯达黎加过不去
What's with you and Costa Rica?!

144
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:04,480
因为那是个糟糕的主意
It's a terrible idea!

145
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:06,380
你总是头脑发热冲动做决定
You get into things without thinking,

146
00:05:06,380 --> 00:05:07,580
你需要被当头棒喝
and you need to be rescued,

147
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:09,040
就像上次你买的那辆车
like that time you bought that car

148
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,260
说什么可以变成一条船
that was supposed to turn into a boat!

149
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:11,400
-怎么了 -结果变成沉船
- Yeah? - It turned into a reef!

150
00:05:11,411 --> 00:05:13,100
那是因为你手贱没关车门
That's 'cause you left your door cracked open!

151
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:14,000
是啊 又变成我的责任了
Yes, it was my fault.

152
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:14,860
记住我的话
Mark my words --

153
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,980
哥斯达黎加就是下一个
Costa Rica is another amphibicar

154
00:05:16,980 --> 00:05:17,960
沉在湖底的水下汽车
at the bottom of a lake.

155
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:20,200
只不过这一次 我不会再捞你起来了
Only this time, I won't be bailing you out!

156
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:21,320
谁要你捞了
Who asked you?!

157
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,480
达琳 我们走
Darlene, we're going!

158
00:05:24,467 --> 00:05:26,500
怎么了 为什么要走
Wha-- wha-- what do you mean, we're going?

159
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:27,520
谢谢款待 歌洛莉亚
Gracias, Gloria.

160
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,040
晚餐很棒
That was a lovely dinner.

161
00:05:29,060 --> 00:05:32,620
你能忍受得了这个家伙实在太伟大了
And you are an incredible woman for putting up with this gringo!

162
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,760
-快点 -怎么回事
- Come on! - What happened?

163
00:05:35,860 --> 00:05:37,000
祝你在哥斯达黎加有好运
Good luck in Costa Rica!

164
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,523
-谢谢你 杰 -他在说反话
- Aw, thanks, Jay. - He didn't mean it!

165
00:05:39,523 --> 00:05:43,066
我知道 我只是想缓和下气氛
I know! I'm trying to defuse the tension.

166
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,700
-上酒了 -太棒了
- Here we go, guys. - Oh, yeah!

167
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:55,560
-再来三杯莫吉托 -好喝极了
- Three more Mojitos. - Yum!

168
00:05:55,562 --> 00:05:55,800
是不是美味到爆啊
Aren't these yum?

169
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,360
我第一杯都没碰过
I didn't even drink the first one.

170
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,880
你确定吗 它总不会平白无故消失了吧
Are you sure? 'cause I don't think it drank itself.

171
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,120
是啊 确实不是
No, it did not.

172
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,600
我喝酒一点问题都没有
Look, I have no problem drinking.

173
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:05,720
说真的姐倒立着都能喝酒
I can literally do it standing on my head.

174
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,480
但是 首先 我不跟爸妈一起喝
But, "A," not with my parents,

175
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,600
其次 我得保持清醒
and plus, also, I needed to stay sharp,

176
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,220
因为他们显然醉翁之意不在酒
because they were obviously up to something,

177
00:06:11,220 --> 00:06:12,400
而且我也没心情喝酒
and I was in no mood.

178
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,760
昨晚我才睡了不到10个小时
I barely got 10 hours of sleep last night.

179
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:17,680
我给你们再拿点水
So, I'll go get you guys some more water,

180
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,100
主菜应该马上就来了
and your food should be out in just a few minutes.

181
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:21,120
谢谢你伙计 你的服务很周到
Thanks so much, pal. We appreciate it.

182
00:06:21,409 --> 00:06:23,414
他看上去真是积极进取啊 对吧
He seems like a real go-getter, huh?

183
00:06:23,414 --> 00:06:25,140
因为他总是"进"厨房"取"东西吗
Oh, 'cause he goes and gets things?

184
00:06:25,140 --> 00:06:26,820
我想知道他对人生有什么规划
I wonder what he wants to do with his life.

185
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:28,560
我总是很好奇别人的人生规划
I wonder that about people all the time.

186
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,020
我觉得这很正常
I think that's very common,

187
00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:34,020
想知道其他人的志向
to wonder about other people's aspirations.

188
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:34,920
我总是这样
I do it all the time.

189
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:37,200
-是 你是这样 -好了 水来了
- Yeah, you do. - Yeah. Here we go.

190
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,860
布莱恩 作为一个年轻人
Hey, Brian, you're a young guy.

191
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:41,564
你在这之后想做点什么 有什么规划吗
Wha-- wha-- what do you want to do after this? What's your plan?

192
00:06:41,564 --> 00:06:43,360
说实话
Uh, to be perfectly honest,

193
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:45,600
我大概会回家 看看电影 再磕点药
I'm probably gonna go home, watch a movie, and get high.

194
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,360
你们在考虑饭后的活动吗
You guys looking for something to do?

195
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,340
不 不 不
No. No. No.

196
00:06:48,340 --> 00:06:49,198
我还有点存货
Oh. I mean, I think I got extra.

197
00:06:49,198 --> 00:06:49,874
不用了 你真是...
No, no, that's --

198
00:06:49,874 --> 00:06:51,783
他是在问你对人生的规划
I-I think he meant your plan for your life,

199
00:06:51,783 --> 00:06:53,520
不是指今天晚上
not -- not just tonight.

200
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:55,140
我想当编剧
Oh. I want to be a screenwriter.

201
00:06:55,796 --> 00:06:58,165
-很有理想 -真有意思
- Ambitious. - And -- and so interesting.

202
00:06:58,165 --> 00:06:59,800
是不是啊 海莉
Isn't that interesting, Haley?

203
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,300
-当然了 -你应该跟他说说你的事
- Sure. - You should tell him what you're doing.

204
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,540
你是说在我们一起跟布莱恩嗑完药之后吗
Oh, you mean after we all go get high with Brian?

205
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:04,360
那是不可能的
That's not happening.

206
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:05,460
很抱歉拒绝你 我是说
I'm sorry. I meant that --

207
00:07:05,460 --> 00:07:06,260
我知道你们的意思
No, I know what you meant.

208
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:07,400
布莱恩 你可以回避一下吗
Hey, Brian, could you give us a second?

209
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:08,910
好 当然
Uh, ye-- sure.

210
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,220
这就是你们今天带我来的原因
So this is what this whole night's about --

211
00:07:11,220 --> 00:07:13,440
鸡尾酒 假装是我朋友 都是幌子
the drinks, the pretending to be my friend?

212
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,660
我们确实是你的朋友
We are your friend.

213
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:17,200
亲爱的 我们很关心你
Honey, we care about you.

214
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:19,920
我们想确定你有自己的人生规划
And we want to make sure that you -- you've got a plan,

215
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:22,340
因为看上去你在混日子
'cause it seems like you're meandering.

216
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:24,660
别这样 亲爱的 不要每次谈到
No. Sweetie, don't just start texting

217
00:07:24,660 --> 00:07:25,800
你不喜欢的话题就开始玩手机
because you don't like the conversation.

218
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,760
-看 -这是什么
- Here. - What is this?

219
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:29,600
这是我一直在写的博客
That's a blog that I've been doing.

220
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,960
我真的很喜欢我拍的照片
I'm really liking my photography,

221
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:34,300
别人也总说他们喜欢我的穿衣风格
and people always say that they like the way that I dress,

222
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:37,060
所以我就在这个网站上传我的穿着搭配
so I've been posting pictures of my outfits on this site.

223
00:07:37,263 --> 00:07:39,680
我知道现在还赚不了多少钱
I know it's not a huge money-maker right now,

224
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,980
但每当有人点击链接 买我穿的衣服时
but I do get money whenever someone clicks on a link

225
00:07:41,980 --> 00:07:43,160
我就会有收入
and buys something that I wore.

226
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:45,620
下学期我会去上商务课
I'm gonna take a business class next semester,

227
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:47,260
希望能帮助我通过现在做的事
which I'm hoping will help me turn all of this

228
00:07:47,260 --> 00:07:48,240
成为一个造型师
into becoming a stylist.

229
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:50,020
我已经有1200个粉丝了
I have 1,200 followers.

230
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:52,080
多数是想知道怎样穿衣搭配的女人
Most are women who want to know what to wear.

231
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:54,260
还有一些想知道我穿什么的男人
Some are men who want to know what I'm wearing,

232
00:07:54,260 --> 00:07:55,460
不过我已经在想办法
But, you know, I'm trying to figure a way

233
00:07:55,460 --> 00:07:56,700
屏蔽那些变态了
to block all of the pervs.

234
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,520
所以 这就是我的规划
So, yeah. I guess that is my plan.

235
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,300
真是太棒了
It's amazing.

236
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:03,140
我们真为你骄傲
We are so proud of you.

237
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:06,020
省省吧 你们总是用恶意揣测我
Don't even, guys. You always assume the worst of me.

238
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:06,720
亲爱的
Honey --

239
00:08:07,060 --> 00:08:08,340
你们两个坐在那儿
No, you guys sit here

240
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,000
假装是我的朋友 却对我评头论足
acting like we're drinking buddies, judging me,

241
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,480
事实是我对未来的规划比你们两个
when I have a better handle on my future

242
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,300
在我这么大时能做到的都要好
than either one of you did at my age.

243
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,140
你曾经想做个魔术师
You? You wanted to be a magician.

244
00:08:16,152 --> 00:08:18,480
而你呢 三分钟就换一次专业
And you were changing your major every three minutes,

245
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,300
这是外公告诉我的
according to grandpa --

246
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:19,900
顺便说一句
who, by the way,

247
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:21,580
我和外公一起喝酒好多年了
has been drinking with me for years

248
00:08:21,580 --> 00:08:22,640
因为他爱我
because he loves me,

249
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:24,680
而且觉得我喝高了的时候说话很风趣
and he thinks I say funny things when I'm buzzed.

250
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:31,380
很显然 叙利亚局势日趋紧张
Well, apparently, the situation in Syria is worsening.

251
00:08:31,380 --> 00:08:32,040
是啊
I know.

252
00:08:33,697 --> 00:08:36,400
现在联合国有证据显示阿萨德
In fact, now U.N. evidence suggests that Assad was --

253
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,420
你是在照着手机念么
Are you reading this off your phone?

254
00:08:37,540 --> 00:08:37,920
什么
What?!

255
00:08:37,972 --> 00:08:38,741
你在
You're --

256
00:08:38,751 --> 00:08:40,560
不是 没有
No! No! What --

257
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,800
-我只是在确认没有记错细节 -小卡
- I was just making sure my facts were straight... - Cam.

258
00:08:42,800 --> 00:08:45,280
以便我对当今局势高谈阔论
...before I started a spirited conversation of current events.

259
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:46,764
好吧
Yeah.

260
00:08:50,780 --> 00:08:51,620
还说什么了
What else does it say?

261
00:08:52,534 --> 00:08:53,500
谢谢
Thank you.

262
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,000
不好意思 那是金枪鱼鞑靼吗
Sorry. Is that the tuna tartare?

263
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:57,420
是啊 很好吃
Yes, and it is delicious.

264
00:08:57,429 --> 00:08:58,998
我应该点那个的
Oh, I should've ordered it.

265
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:00,160
想尝一口吗
Would you like a taste?

266
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:03,200
不用了 但是谢谢 你人真好
Oh, no. But thank you. That's very sweet.

267
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:06,100
她是认真的 卡蒂喜欢跟别人分享食物
She really means it. Uh, Katie loves sharing food.

268
00:09:06,260 --> 00:09:07,400
我也是 我觉得
Me, too. You know, I think

269
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,480
在大家庭里长大都会这样
it's growing up in a big family,

270
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,120
因为晚餐桌上的所有东西
'cause everything at suppertime on the table

271
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,220
都是给大家一起吃的
was up for grabs.

272
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:12,620
我们不做饭前祷告
We didn't say grace.

273
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,500
我们会说 各就各位 预备 开吃
We said, "On your marks, get set, go."

274
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,300
你的语气跟我爸完全一样
You sound exactly like my dad.

275
00:09:16,300 --> 00:09:18,360
他出生在密苏里一个很大的家庭里
He was from this really big family in Missouri, and --

276
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:18,980
不是吧
Shut up!

277
00:09:19,420 --> 00:09:20,680
我自己就是个密苏里的乡下孩子
I'm a Missouri farm boy, myself!

278
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:23,280
-不是吧 -天啊 我叫小卡
- Stop! - Oh, my gosh! I'm Cam.

279
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:25,400
很高兴认识你 小卡
Well, right pleased to meet you, Cam.

280
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:26,100
这是布兰登
This is Brandon.

281
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:28,280
你好 她平常不这样说话的
Hi. She doesn't really talk like that.

282
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:30,060
他时不时也会有口音
Oh, well, he slips in and out of his accent

283
00:09:30,060 --> 00:09:31,320
就像《泰坦尼克号》里的凯特·温丝莱特
like Kate Winslet in "Titanic."

284
00:09:32,884 --> 00:09:34,925
-我叫米奇尔 -你好
- Uh, I'm Mitchell, by the way. - Hi.

285
00:09:34,925 --> 00:09:36,500
-你好 -你点了什么 布兰登
- Hi. - What -- what's yours, Brandon?

286
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:37,840
看起来也很好吃
It looks delicious, too.

287
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:40,600
这是马铃薯干酪松露
It's the truffle parmesan gnocchi.

288
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:42,940
但是你知道吗 如果你想尝一口那个
Do you know what, though? If you want a bite of that,

289
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,220
你就找错人了
you're barking up the wrong tree.

290
00:09:44,220 --> 00:09:47,092
因为那是一个严格的不分享区
'cause that dish is in a strict no-share zone.

291
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:48,040
我只是
I just --

292
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,380
不喜欢别人从我的盘子里吃东西
I don't like people eating off my plate.

293
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,420
因为我们不是动物 我也一样
Yeah, because you're not an animal. I'm the same way.

294
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:53,320
天啊 我们完全一样
Oh, my gosh! You're exactly us!

295
00:09:53,340 --> 00:09:54,700
不 你们要更有趣
No, you guys are more interesting,

296
00:09:54,712 --> 00:09:56,100
因为你们基情四射
'cause you have the whole gay thing.

297
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:58,020
卡蒂 你都不知道他们是不是
Katie, you don't know if they're gay.

298
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,740
你真可爱
Okay, that's adorable.

299
00:09:59,740 --> 00:10:02,020
是啊 我们的关系很明显
Yeah, it was -- it was a pretty safe bet.

300
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:03,820
我要去下洗手间
Okay. I'm running to the powder room.

301
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,200
小卡 尝尝这个
Cam, please try the tartare,

302
00:10:05,210 --> 00:10:06,822
一会儿不管你点了什么 我也要尝尝
because whatever you order, I want a taste.

303
00:10:06,822 --> 00:10:08,590
没问题 不过你要快点回来
Okay. Well, don't you dillydally,

304
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:11,400
因为我一挂上饲料袋就慢不下来
because I ain't exactly slow once I tie on the ol' feed bag!

305
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:12,540
别激动 亲爱的
Calm down, honey boo boo.

306
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:15,400
-她真可爱 -超级可爱
- She's so cute! - Very adorable.

307
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,921
布兰登 你是做什么工作的
So, Brandon, what do you do for a living? Are you --

308
00:10:16,921 --> 00:10:18,680
听我说 伙计们 我不想这么没礼貌
Look, guys. I-I hate to be blunt,

309
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:21,280
但是你们能不能给我们一点空间
but could you please give us some space?

310
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:23,920
没问题
Not a problem.

311
00:10:24,420 --> 00:10:25,980
不 不是
Look, no -- no, it's --

312
00:10:25,980 --> 00:10:28,640
你们人很好 只是我
I mean, you guys are great. But I'm gonna...

313
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:30,440
我今晚要向卡蒂求婚
propose to Katie tonight.

314
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,611
而我觉现在有点...
And I'm kind of feeling -- yeah.

315
00:10:31,611 --> 00:10:32,515
什么 在这吗
What?! Here?!

316
00:10:32,515 --> 00:10:34,200
天啊 这太棒了
Oh, my god! That's amazing!

317
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:36,840
我们几个月前刚刚订婚
We just got engaged a few months ago.

318
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,066
太好了
Great.

319
00:10:37,066 --> 00:10:39,009
所以我们一定会尊重你们的隐私
Yeah, so we will definitely give you your privacy.

320
00:10:39,009 --> 00:10:40,187
-恭喜你 -是啊
- Congratulations. - Absolutely.

321
00:10:40,187 --> 00:10:41,300
祝你好运
Yeah. Good luck.

322
00:10:41,300 --> 00:10:42,500
这样吧 如果你想的话
You know what? If you wanted,

323
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:43,940
我可以假装在发短信
I could pretend like I'm texting,

324
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:46,420
然后用手机把整个过程录下来
and I could video the whole thing on my phone.

325
00:10:46,660 --> 00:10:47,940
这样你就能留作纪念了
That way, you'd have it forever.

326
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:48,887
真的吗 好啊
Really? I mean, that -- yeah.

327
00:10:48,887 --> 00:10:50,500
-那太好了 -你确定吗
- That would be awesome. - A-are you sure?

328
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:53,040
他很容易过于激动
He gets very, uh, well, excited.

329
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,660
有可能会漏出马脚
And he might give it away.

330
00:10:54,660 --> 00:10:57,080
米奇尔 我觉得凭我对卡蒂的了解
Mitchell, um, I think I know Katie well enough

331
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,580
我能看出她有没有起疑心
to tell if she's getting suspicious.

332
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,520
-小卡 -她说过我可以尝尝的
- Cam?! - She said I could.

333
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:05,280
见鬼的开瓶器去哪儿了
The hell's the corkscrew?

334
00:11:07,460 --> 00:11:08,832
你想谈谈吗
Do you want to talk about it?

335
00:11:08,832 --> 00:11:10,620
没什么可谈的
There's nothing to talk about!

336
00:11:10,620 --> 00:11:12,300
小短总是做傻事
Shorty does dumb things all the time.

337
00:11:12,451 --> 00:11:14,500
我打赌 不出三个月
You mark my words -- in three months,

338
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:16,200
他就会花光钱滚回来了
he'll be back here needing money.

339
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,840
也许你不高兴不是因为小短会滚回来
Maybe this is not about Shorty coming back.

340
00:11:17,900 --> 00:11:19,740
而是因为小短可能不会回来了
Maybe this is about Shorty not coming back.

341
00:11:20,780 --> 00:11:21,080
曼尼
Manny.

342
00:11:21,260 --> 00:11:22,880
她的意思是 在你内心深处
What she's saying is, deep down,

343
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:25,060
害怕小短会爱上哥斯达黎加
you're afraid Shorty's going to love Costa Rica,

344
00:11:25,060 --> 00:11:26,780
你就永远失去自己最好的朋友了
and you'll lose your best friend forever.

345
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:27,740
你一直都是这样
That's what you do.

346
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,580
你故意疏远别人 这样他们离开时
You push people away, so when they leave,

347
00:11:29,580 --> 00:11:30,760
你就不会那么难受
it doesn't hurt that much.

348
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:33,400
我搞不明白 你们这代人那么伟大
I don't get it. You're the greatest generation,

349
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,520
怎么就没有情感呢
but why can't you feel?

350
00:11:34,660 --> 00:11:36,160
你怎么不能像其他青春期少年
Why can't you spend your teen years

351
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:38,000
整天呆在房间不出来呢
locked in your bedroom like a normal kid?

352
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,196
看吧 他现在在疏远我了
See? Now he's doing it to me.

353
00:11:40,448 --> 00:11:42,120
杰 这是你必须面对的
Uh, you have to face it, Jay.

354
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,940
我终有一天会搬出去
One day, I'll be moving out of this house.

355
00:11:44,060 --> 00:11:44,900
你可以写个保证吗
Can I get that in writing?

356
00:11:44,900 --> 00:11:47,540
我脑海里现在都是30岁的你
'cause I just can't shake this image of a 30-year-old you

357
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:49,520
吃着我的食物 还黏着我老婆
eating my food and cuddling with my wife.

358
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,600
男孩子永远都该黏他们的妈妈
Boys should never stop cuddling their mothers.

359
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:53,035
我会做噩梦的
I'm gonna have nightmares!

360
00:11:53,220 --> 00:11:55,080
你假装很强硬
You pretend to be so tough.

361
00:11:55,140 --> 00:11:56,080
可你知道我怎么想吗
But you know what I think?

362
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,960
我觉得事实上
I think that deep down,

363
00:11:57,960 --> 00:12:00,360
你才是这屋子里感情最细腻的人
you're the most sensitive person in this house.

364
00:12:01,340 --> 00:12:01,820
看吧
See?

365
00:12:02,580 --> 00:12:03,400
又开始了
You did it again.

366
00:12:03,860 --> 00:12:06,040
一说到这种敏感的话题
I say something that strikes a nerve,

367
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,100
你就受不了了
and immediately, you cannot handle it.

368
00:12:08,100 --> 00:12:09,940
所以你才这样逃避话题
That's why you "Pbht" in my face!

369
00:12:09,940 --> 00:12:12,480
终于发现一个你不那么可爱的地方了
We just found the one thing you can't make sexy.

370
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:13,420
又来了
There it is again.

371
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:14,420
我需要喝一杯
I need a drink.

372
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:18,540
杰 你得跟小短说清楚
Jay, you have to make this right with Shorty.

373
00:12:19,020 --> 00:12:21,180
告诉他你的真实感受
You have to tell him how you feel!

374
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:24,740
他可是你那么多年的老朋友
He has been a great compadre with you for many years.

375
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:27,400
除了他还有谁给你的笑话捧场
Besides, who else is going to laugh at your jokes?

376
00:12:27,540 --> 00:12:28,980
大把人欣赏我的笑话
Lots of people laugh at my jokes.

377
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:31,100
除了你的员工以外还有别人吗
Name one person that doesn't work for you.

378
00:12:31,260 --> 00:12:33,380
要不你们两个还是一边温存去吧
Hey, you know what? Why don't you two just go cuddle?

379
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:36,280
她来了
Okay, here she comes.

380
00:12:36,460 --> 00:12:37,040
淡定
Stay calm.

381
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,340
-你会露馅的 -你才要淡定
- You're gonna spoil it. - You stay calm.

382
00:12:38,340 --> 00:12:39,640
看起来真不错 这是什么
Ooh, that looks good. What is it?

383
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:42,100
这个是烤鱿鱼圈
Um, uh, this is the grilled calamari.

384
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:44,180
很美味的 你要不要来一"环"
It's scrumptious. Would you care for a ring?

385
00:12:44,180 --> 00:12:46,508
我是说你要不要尝一下 亲
I -- um, I mean, dig in there, girlfriend!

386
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:47,980
不用了 谢谢
Oh, no, that's okay. Thank you.

387
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:50,060
看起来超美味
This looks so delicious.

388
00:12:50,220 --> 00:12:51,760
我的也很美味
Yeah, mine's delicious, too.

389
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:54,280
卡蒂
Katie...

390
00:12:54,280 --> 00:12:56,120
你今晚真美
You look so beautiful tonight.

391
00:12:57,627 --> 00:12:59,360
要知道我从来没遇到过像你这么好的人
You know, I-I've never met anyone like you,

392
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:01,272
我也知道不可能再遇到了
and I know that I never will. And I...

393
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:04,720
我好爱你
I love you so much.

394
00:13:05,660 --> 00:13:09,080
你能让我变成世界上最幸福的男人吗
Will you make me the happiest man on earth

395
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:11,440
-嫁给我 -什么
- and be my bride? - What?!

396
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:13,340
我的天啊
Oh, my god!

397
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:15,660
-不行 -不行吗
- No! - No?

398
00:13:16,260 --> 00:13:16,560
不行
No!

399
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:18,480
对不起
Sorry.

400
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,840
你知道这里以前是个银行吗
Did you know that this place used to be a bank?

401
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:21,580
真的哦
Was it, really?

402
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:24,160
我只是 我不想结婚 布兰登
I just -- I don't want to be married, Brandon.

403
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:25,540
我们会变得跟那些
We'll end up like one of those couples

404
00:13:25,540 --> 00:13:27,560
相对无言的夫妻一样
that just sits there with nothing to talk about

405
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:29,240
直到移情别恋
until we glom on to other people.

406
00:13:30,719 --> 00:13:33,613
我简直不敢相信 你 你不爱我吗
I can't believe this. You -- you don't love me?

407
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:34,920
-不 -不爱吗
- NO! - NO?

408
00:13:34,929 --> 00:13:36,272
-对不起 -不
- I'm sor... - NO!

409
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,940
我需要透透气
I need some air.

410
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:44,080
叙利亚那边有什么新情况
So, Syria, any updates?

411
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,694
-还没什么 -没有啊
- No, nothing yet. - Nothing.

412
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:53,180
你还记得她小时候发不出"p"这个音
Do you remember how cute she was when she was little

413
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:55,770
-有多可爱吗 -烤"堵"豆
- and she couldn't say her P's? - "BAKE A-TATOES."

414
00:13:55,770 --> 00:13:58,762
烤"堵"豆 还有"饼"果酱
"Bake a-tatoes" and "Attlesauce".

415
00:13:58,762 --> 00:13:59,385
"饼"果酱
"Attlesauce"!

416
00:13:59,385 --> 00:14:00,740
能给我点"饼"果酱吗
"Can I have attlesauce?"

417
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:02,100
首先 你有点高了
First of all, you're screaming.

418
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:04,080
我们可以买单了吗 拜托
Can we just get the check, please?

419
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,580
你可以不要生我们的气了吗
Could you please not be mad at us anymore?

420
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:09,720
我们很抱歉让你有被摆布的感觉
We are very sorry that you felt manipulated.

421
00:14:10,420 --> 00:14:11,960
你们知道我觉得最讽刺的是什么吗
You know what I'm pretty sure is ironic?

422
00:14:12,268 --> 00:14:14,140
你们花那么多时间担心
You guys spend all this time worrying

423
00:14:14,140 --> 00:14:15,340
我将来要做什么
about what I'm going to do,

424
00:14:15,340 --> 00:14:16,720
但也许你们应该开始思考一下
and maybe you should start thinking

425
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:18,140
你们要做什么了
about what you're going to do.

426
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,520
这是什么意思
What are you talking about?

427
00:14:20,799 --> 00:14:22,831
我们都离开家以后你们打算做什么
Well, what are you gonna do when we're gone?

428
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,420
有什么计划
What's your plan?

429
00:14:24,442 --> 00:14:26,692
-我们会好好的 -是啊
- Uh, to be fine. - Yeah.

430
00:14:26,692 --> 00:14:28,240
-因为我们很好啊 -特别好
- 'cause we're fine. - Totally.

431
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:29,460
你们都走了
You guys are gone.

432
00:14:29,552 --> 00:14:31,600
我们就买辆休旅车
We get an R.V. Bam!

433
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:32,960
我 你妈妈
Me, mama...

434
00:14:33,620 --> 00:14:35,680
外加一条狗 默林 踏上旅程
and our dog, Merlin, hit the open road.

435
00:14:35,860 --> 00:14:38,280
不 我可不要把我的晚年
No. I am not spending my golden years

436
00:14:38,280 --> 00:14:39,680
浪费在一个个房车公园里
driving around an R.V. park,

437
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:41,700
整日寻找地方安营扎寨
looking for a place to plug my house in.

438
00:14:41,700 --> 00:14:44,458
不 我要去周游世界
No. I am gonna go see the world.

439
00:14:44,458 --> 00:14:45,493
那你想去哪里
Where do you wanna go?

440
00:14:45,493 --> 00:14:48,087
我不知道 菲尔 印度 非洲
I don't know, Phil. India. Africa.

441
00:14:48,096 --> 00:14:49,180
痢疾 会得痢疾
Diarrhea. Diarrhea.

442
00:14:49,180 --> 00:14:52,060
看起来你们真的要开始规划一下
Wow. It sounds like you guys really need to start thinking

443
00:14:52,060 --> 00:14:53,140
你们的未来了
about your future.

444
00:14:53,140 --> 00:14:55,000
我们走后你要让默林住在狗舍吗
Are you just gonna put Merlin in a kennel when we're gone?

445
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,980
菲尔 默林根本不存在
Okay, Phil, Merlin doesn't exist.

446
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:59,380
孩子们走后你为何要
And why do you want to get a dog to take care of

447
00:14:59,380 --> 00:15:00,540
急于找只狗来养呢
so soon after the kids leave?

448
00:15:00,540 --> 00:15:02,630
因为我需要有人疼爱 克莱尔
Well, I'm gonna need someone to love me, Claire.

449
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:03,900
与此同时 妈妈
And in the meantime, mom,

450
00:15:04,020 --> 00:15:05,980
外公想让你接管公司 但是
grandpa wants you to take over the business, but...

451
00:15:05,980 --> 00:15:08,240
那是你想要的吗
Do you want that?

452
00:15:09,500 --> 00:15:11,680
这么久远的事情我还没想过
I-I guess I hadn't thought this far into the future.

453
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:14,420
爸爸 你要一直以卖房子为生吗
And, dad, are you just gonna keep selling houses?

454
00:15:14,420 --> 00:15:16,460
我不是想要动摇你的心思
I mean, I don't want to blow your mind here,

455
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:18,360
但你还是可以成为一个魔术师啊
but you could still be a magician.

456
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,480
我可以
I could.

457
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:20,900
他不行
He couldn't.

458
00:15:21,300 --> 00:15:21,560
真的吗
Really?

459
00:15:21,862 --> 00:15:25,604
你身后的这个盐罐可不是这么说的
This salt shaker behind your head says different.

460
00:15:25,740 --> 00:15:28,020
菲尔 你把盐弄到我身上了
Oh, Phil, you're getting salt all over me.

461
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:29,180
我要变成玛格丽特了[想要一杯]
I feel like a Margarita.

462
00:15:29,420 --> 00:15:30,920
-马上来 -不 不 不 不
- You got it! - No, no, no, no, no, no!

463
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,140
结账吧 麻烦了
Just the check, please.

464
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:32,880
好的
Okay.

465
00:15:33,580 --> 00:15:34,860
非常感谢你
Thank you so much.

466
00:15:34,860 --> 00:15:36,440
-谢了 兄弟 -多谢
- Thanks, buddy. - Yeah.

467
00:15:36,636 --> 00:15:39,430
糟了 我的钱包在另一件外套里
Oh, no. I left my wallet in the other coat.

468
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:41,380
我没带包包
I did not bring my purse.

469
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,680
没事 我来吧
It's fine, guys. I got this.

470
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:48,409
-谢谢你宝贝 -谢谢你 亲爱的
- Honey, thank you. - Oh, thank you, sweetie.

471
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:50,820
-等下看来也要我来开车了吧 -是啊
- I should probably drive, too, huh? - Probably.

472
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:52,400
-我觉得 也是 -是啊
- I gue-- yeah. - Yeah.

473
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:54,480
不如我留在这里结账 你们去叫门童
Why don't you guys have the valet pull the car up

474
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:55,380
把车取来
while I pay the check?

475
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,280
这倒是可以
That we can do.

476
00:16:03,301 --> 00:16:04,333
伙计们 那边
Uh, you guys, it's that way.

477
00:16:04,333 --> 00:16:05,851
-是吧 -是啊
- Mm-hmm. - It is.

478
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:15,520
顺便说一下 我们其实有很多可聊的
Y-you know, for the record, we do have a lot to talk about.

479
00:16:15,520 --> 00:16:17,540
今天只是把有些话题先放一放
Yeah, we just took a couple of topics off the table

480
00:16:17,540 --> 00:16:19,620
因为我们今晚想来一次浪漫的约会
because we wanted to have a romantic date night.

481
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:22,400
也许我们太想让今晚特别一点了
And it probably put too much pressure on it to be special,

482
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:26,460
事实上我和他在一起的每一天都很特别
but the truth is, every day I spend with this man is special.

483
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:27,946
小卡
Oh, Cam!

484
00:16:28,060 --> 00:16:29,960
不 我才是幸运的那个人
Oh, no, I'm the lucky one.

485
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:31,200
我们都是
There we are.

486
00:16:32,140 --> 00:16:32,740
抱歉
I'm sorry.

487
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:35,420
我想刚才布兰登求婚时我只是慌乱了
I guess I just panicked when Brandon asked me.

488
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:38,780
我们很不一样 我知道这看来
I mean, we're so different. And I know it seems petty,

489
00:16:38,780 --> 00:16:40,352
很矫情 但其实不然
but it speaks to something bigger.

490
00:16:40,420 --> 00:16:42,380
我不知道我能否与一个
I don't know if I can spend the rest of my life

491
00:16:42,380 --> 00:16:44,320
不让我碰他食物的人共度余生
with the kind of guy who won't let me eat off his plate.

492
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,700
相信我 那不是问题
Trust me -- it can be done.

493
00:16:45,940 --> 00:16:48,460
我也不应该太在乎这件事
And I should not make such a big deal about that.

494
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,640
我保证会努力调整的
I promise I'll try and do better.

495
00:16:49,740 --> 00:16:51,240
不 你说得对 你不喜欢我那样
No, you're right. You don't like it,

496
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,600
我就应该尊重你的喜好
and I should respect that more.

497
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:53,700
你们结婚了吗
Are you guys married?

498
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:54,660
今年五月结
Oh, this May.

499
00:16:54,660 --> 00:16:58,119
-但我们算是结婚很多年了 -是的
- But, basically, we've been married for years. - Yeah.

500
00:16:58,119 --> 00:17:00,460
小卡难道就是我心中的完美人选吗
I-I mean, is Cam everything that I dreamed of?

501
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:01,380
谨言慎行 律师
Tread lightly, counselor.

502
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:03,440
是的 他就是
Yes. Yes, he is.

503
00:17:03,700 --> 00:17:05,420
因为尽管经历了种种妥协
Because through all the compromises

504
00:17:05,420 --> 00:17:07,140
协商与争执
and negotiations and arguments

505
00:17:07,180 --> 00:17:08,740
甚至是厌倦情绪
and sometimes even boredom,

506
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:11,440
我无法想象没有他的生活
I cannot picture my life without him.

507
00:17:11,580 --> 00:17:12,160
说得真好
That's very sweet.

508
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,820
但要是我就不会说厌倦 不过
I would've scooted past the boredom, but...

509
00:17:13,820 --> 00:17:16,120
说到最后 卡蒂 你必须问问你自己
At the end of the day, Katie, you have to ask yourself,

510
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:18,440
你能想象没有这个人的生活吗
can you imagine your life without this person?

511
00:17:20,376 --> 00:17:21,508
好了
Hey. All right, look.

512
00:17:21,519 --> 00:17:23,909
我买完单了 我们走吧
I, uh, paid the check, okay? Let's just go.

513
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:25,120
布兰登 你能先坐下吗
Brandon, can you just please sit?

514
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:26,800
我一直在和他们两个聊
I've been talking to the guys here,

515
00:17:26,800 --> 00:17:28,916
他们真的让我想了很多
and they really opened my eyes.

516
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,020
真的吗
They did?

517
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:30,900
是的
Yes.

518
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:34,740
我尝试着想象没有你的生活
I've been trying to picture my life without you, and...

519
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:36,020
你知道吗
You know what?

520
00:17:37,060 --> 00:17:37,940
我能接受
I can.

521
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,000
我们可没那么说
We didn't tell her that.

522
00:17:40,140 --> 00:17:40,820
我没那么说
I didn't say that.

523
00:17:40,820 --> 00:17:43,190
不 我想和你们一样 懂吗
No, I want what you guys have, okay?

524
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,520
抱歉 布兰登
I'm sorry, Brandon.

525
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:47,080
对不起 但我们都该有那样的感情
I am so sorry, but we both deserve that.

526
00:17:47,260 --> 00:17:49,320
我从未如此确定过
I've never been so sure of anything.

527
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:51,800
好了 我还是
You know what? I'm just...

528
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,815
打车回去好了
gonna go get a cab, okay?

529
00:17:54,540 --> 00:17:55,020
再见
Goodbye.

530
00:17:55,020 --> 00:17:56,600
谢谢
And thank you.

531
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:58,500
-别 别谢我们 -我们什么都没做
- Don't-- don't thank us! - We didn't do anything,

532
00:17:58,500 --> 00:17:59,860
我们真的没有
So... we didn't, honestly.

533
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,780
这真是我人生最悲剧的一晚
This is the worst night of my life.

534
00:18:02,020 --> 00:18:02,760
抱歉
I'm sorry.

535
00:18:03,204 --> 00:18:05,676
但是好在一切都结束了
But, I mean, um, a-at least now it's over.

536
00:18:05,676 --> 00:18:07,787
你可以开始新生活了
You can... start to move on.

537
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:11,440
我尝试着想象没有你的生活
I've been trying to picture my life without you.

538
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:13,040
你知道吗
And you know what?

539
00:18:13,106 --> 00:18:15,247
-傻缺手机 -我能接受
- S-stupid phone. - I can.

540
00:18:15,260 --> 00:18:17,840
这手机着魔了
It's a... devil phone.

541
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:23,880
米奇尔出生时 早产了一个月
When Mitchell was born, he was a month premature.

542
00:18:23,980 --> 00:18:26,100
当时事态很紧急
So it was touch and go there for a while.

543
00:18:26,465 --> 00:18:27,847
是凌晨两点
It's 2 a.m.

544
00:18:27,860 --> 00:18:30,720
我走进医院的等候室想喘口气
I walk out into the hospital waiting room to get some air,

545
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:32,140
小短也在
and there's Shorty.

546
00:18:33,380 --> 00:18:35,040
他在那坐了六个小时了
He'd been sitting there for six hours

547
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:37,520
还坚持要继续再呆两天
and refused to leave for the next two days.

548
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:39,820
米奇尔的中间名就是这么来的
That's where we got Mitchell's middle name.

549
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:40,540
不是叫小短
Not Shorty --

550
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:42,080
是文森特
Vincent.

551
00:18:42,645 --> 00:18:44,218
M.V.P[最有价值球员]
"M.V.P."

552
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:47,820
这点上我们也有些不成熟
We were a little premature on that one, too.

553
00:18:50,580 --> 00:18:52,160
歌洛莉亚 我要开车出去了
Gloria, I'm going for a drive!

554
00:18:52,820 --> 00:18:53,940
替我向小短问好
Say hi to Shorty for me!

555
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:55,240
没跟你说话
I'm not talking to you!

556
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,060
我正要去找你
I was just coming to see you.

557
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:04,120
我把外套落在这里了
Um, I left my jacket.

558
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:06,715
在这呢 进来吧
Oh! There it is! Come on in.

559
00:19:12,227 --> 00:19:13,860
小短 你知道我说的那些话
Uh, Shorty, you know that stuff I said, uh --

560
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:15,980
-我懂 -我们没事吧
- Yeah, I get it. - We're good, huh?

561
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:16,800
没事
Under the bridge.

562
00:19:18,780 --> 00:19:19,820
好的 回头见
All right. I'll see you.

563
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:20,960
小短 等等
Shorty, wait.

564
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:24,100
我有话想跟你说
I need to say something to you.

565
00:19:24,260 --> 00:19:24,640
说吧
Yeah.

566
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:28,380
我想说谢谢你
I want to thank you...

567
00:19:28,380 --> 00:19:30,740
感谢我们一同经历的好时光
for all the great times we've had.

568
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:34,060
是啊 我们
Yeah. We, um...

569
00:19:34,260 --> 00:19:35,700
-我们有过很多快乐时光 -是啊
- We had a lot of laughs. - Yeah.

570
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:38,940
你应该知道
And you should know that, uh...

571
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:40,320
你是我最好的朋友
you're my best friend.

572
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:42,100
知道吗
You know?

573
00:19:42,817 --> 00:19:45,488
也许是我一生中最好的朋友
Probably the best friend I'm ever gonna have.

574
00:19:45,500 --> 00:19:47,420
杰 你这是干什么
Jay, I mean... what are you doing to me?

575
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:49,020
这对我有点难 我只是
This is hard for me. I'm just...

576
00:19:49,518 --> 00:19:51,359
我只是想告诉你我的感受
I'm just trying to tell you how I feel.

577
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:53,468
那我也告诉你我的感受
Well, I'm gonna tell you how I feel.

578
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:56,560
我真崇拜你 杰
I admire the hell out of you, Jay.

579
00:19:57,240 --> 00:20:00,320
我总跟达琳说 "这是个真男人"
I always tell Darlene, "That's a real guy."

580
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:02,000
自立 敢说敢干
Self-made, stand-up,

581
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:04,540
是那种你愿意和他在同一战壕奋斗的人
the kind of guy you want to be in a foxhole with.

582
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:05,884
我没那么好
Well, I'm not all that.

583
00:20:05,884 --> 00:20:07,829
我也没下过战壕
Well, it's not like I've been in a foxhole.

584
00:20:12,534 --> 00:20:14,184
我会想你的 文森特
I'm gonna miss you, Vincent.

585
00:20:14,663 --> 00:20:16,058
我也会想你的
I'm gonna miss you, too.

586
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:16,900
我爱你
I love you.

587
00:20:18,595 --> 00:20:20,322
我也爱你 小杰杰
I love you, too, Jay bird.

588
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:22,040
真的非常爱
I really, really do.

589
00:20:26,420 --> 00:20:27,540
给我打电话 好吗
You call me, okay?

590
00:20:27,540 --> 00:20:28,520
每天都打
Every day.

591
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:31,040
每一天
Every damn day.

592
00:20:32,845 --> 00:20:34,240
说实话
If I'm being honest,

593
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:36,360
我没想到场面会这么娘
this is a little girlier than I thought.

594
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:43,040
两年
Two years.

595
00:20:44,360 --> 00:20:45,820
她怎么就这么走了
How could she just walk away?

596
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,780
-知道吗 她这是帮了你 -绝对的
- You know what? She did you a favor. - Absolutely.

597
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:50,760
-你能找到更好的 -好上百倍的
- You can do so much better. - Oh, my god. Insanely better.

598
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:54,080
他没开玩笑 布兰登 你这么帅
No, he's not kidding. Brandon, you are seriously gorge!

599
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:55,680
要我说 她和你在一起绝对是占便宜了
If you ask me, she got the better end of the deal.

600
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:56,880
你们真这么觉得吗
You really think so?

601
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,270
-是啊是啊 -是啊
- Yes! Yes! - Yes!

602
00:20:58,270 --> 00:21:00,113
还有她那头假金发 我不确定
And her whole fake blond thing? I don't know.

603
00:21:00,113 --> 00:21:01,370
-有点不太正经 -而且说实话
- It was kind of trampy. - And truth be told,

604
00:21:01,380 --> 00:21:02,600
她看起来不是很阳光
she didn't seem that bright.

605
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:03,820
她是不是比你大
And is she older than you?

606
00:21:03,820 --> 00:21:06,693
-她看起来比你大多了 -相信我们
- Because she looked significantly older than you. - Trust us.

607
00:21:06,693 --> 00:21:07,320
这是发生在你身上的最好的事了
This is the best thing that's ever happened to you.

608
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:09,460
这辈子发生的最好的事
Best thing that's ever happened to you.

609
00:21:09,500 --> 00:21:11,240
谢天谢地 你还在
Oh! Thank god you're still here!

610
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:13,740
刚刚在回家的路上 突然我就哭了
I was on my way home, and all of a sudden, I started crying.

611
00:21:13,740 --> 00:21:15,400
我意识到我刚刚只是被吓到了
And I realized I was just scared.

612
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:18,180
我爱你 我真的很抱歉
And I love you. And I'm so, so sorry.

613
00:21:18,220 --> 00:21:20,680
我愿意 布兰登 如果你还愿意娶我
And, yes, Brandon, if you'll still have me,

614
00:21:20,680 --> 00:21:22,640
我愿意 我要嫁给你
Yes, I will marry you!

615
00:21:24,440 --> 00:21:26,400
-认识你们很高兴 -走吧
- So nice meeting you. - Okay.
